  "limits": [
    "Denied termination may leave a real process alive. Closed local pipes and confirmed process exit are separate observations; the browser fixture explicitly verifies the alive-child case.",
    "Persisted cleanup metadata describes the end of that call. It is not a live process monitor, and the saved PID is never used as future signal authority.",
    "Only ProcessLookupError from signal-0 confirms an absent group after denied termination; a successful probe or permission denial does not.",
    "The original intermittent operating-system cause remains unproven. Deterministic injection verifies the failure boundary without hiding genuine permission denial.",
    "Focused and full regression counts overlap and must not be added.",
    "No version bump, publication or repeated fresh installation."
  ]
